=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play system-details/report-pager -----------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the System Details screen proposed for slice$
# 1, inferred from origin/main (unreleased), read from a$
# simulated host, by real code where there is some (detect, the$
# header probe, accounts) and by the gallery's stand-ins$
# elsewhere, unit (b)'s to build. It only reads: no plan, no$
# y/N, no journal. Nothing on this machine changes: every$
# command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: system-details/report-pager$
# Debian 13, as debian13. Treatment report-pager: one line per$
# section, an item opening the whole report in the pager. It$
# fits 80x24. The gallery runs no pager: the item says what it$
# would run.$
$
# System Details ###############################################$
$
# Summary ------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  OS and Kernel        Debian 13 (Trixie)$
   -  Host and IPs         web-01, 192.0.2.20/24$
   -  Users                alice$
   -  CPU and Load         4 CPUs, load 0.12$
   -  Disk                 11% of 38.6 GiB$
   -  Memory               30% of 3.8 GiB$
   -  Last Login           alice, Oct 20 11:42$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Open                 The whole report in less$
   2) Refresh              Read the host again$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]: 1$
$
# Note$
# The gallery runs no pager. hardn would run LESSSECURE=1 less,$
# the report on its standard input, then draw this screen again.$
$
# System Details ###############################################$
$
# Summary ------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  OS and Kernel        Debian 13 (Trixie)$
   -  Host and IPs         web-01, 192.0.2.20/24$
   -  Users                alice$
   -  CPU and Load         4 CPUs, load 0.12$
   -  Disk                 11% of 38.6 GiB$
   -  Memory               30% of 3.8 GiB$
   -  Last Login           alice, Oct 20 11:42$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Open                 The whole report in less$
   2) Refresh              Read the host again$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

